96	// [from, to), in time order, selected by the same rule as the roller's
97	// Range: the first window returned is the one containing from, and a
98	// window starting exactly at to is excluded. An interval whose end does
99	// not come after its start yields an empty slice, as does an interval no
100	// coarse window overlaps.
